# Developer-supplied, license-restricted fonts — NOT redistributed in this
# repo. The developer supplies these locally; see ../README.md for where to
# obtain them and how to install them.
#
# Listed by exact filename (anchored with a leading `/`) so that any
# redistributable font added to this directory later is still tracked
# normally — only these specific files are excluded.

# SF Pro / SF Compact — Apple system fonts (Apple license).
/SF-Pro.ttf
/SF-Pro-Italic.ttf
/SF-Compact.ttf
/SF-Compact-Italic.ttf

# Iosevka Fixed — staged .ttf build (consumed directly by the kit).
/Iosevka-Fixed.ttf
/Iosevka-Fixed-Bold.ttf
